flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Disable Preferences logging]
    B --> C[Start Serial communication]
    C --> D[Delay startup]
    D --> E[Print sender version]
    E --> F[Print wake message]

    F --> G[Configure battery pin]
    G --> H[Configure ADC control pin]
    H --> I[Set ADC control HIGH]

    I --> J[Configure OLED active pin input pulldown]
    J --> K[Configure Debug state pin input pulldown]

    K --> L[Power on DS2484]
    L --> M[Load operator variables from NVS]

    M --> N[Initialize Wire bus]
    N --> O[Set Wire clock speed]
    O --> P[Initialize OLED]
    P --> Q[Initialize Wire1 bus]

    Q --> R{DS2484 initialization successful}

    R -- No --> S[Print DS2484 init failed]
    S --> T[Stop execution]

    R -- Yes --> U[Set Wire1 clock speed]

    U --> V[Initialize LoRa]

    V --> W{LoRa initialization successful}

    W -- No --> X[Print LoRa init failed]
    X --> T

    W -- Yes --> Y{Debug switch HIGH}

    Y -- Yes --> Z[Start OTA debug mode]
    Y -- No --> AA[Continue]

    Z --> AA

    AA --> AB[Start LoRa receive mode]

    AB --> AC[Reset device count]
    AC --> AD[Clear DS2413 found flag]

    AD --> AE[Set attempt counter to 0]

    AE --> AF{Attempt less than 3}

    AF -- No --> AG[Print sensor count]
    AG --> AH{DS2413 found}

    AF -- Yes --> AI[Reset one wire bus]

    AI --> AJ{Reset successful}

    AJ -- No --> AK[Delay 100 ms]
    AK --> AL[Increase attempt counter]
    AL --> AF

    AJ -- Yes --> AM[Send search ROM command]

    AM --> AN{One wire device found and count less than 15}

    AN -- Yes --> AO[Print found ROM]
    AO --> AP{Family code is DS18B20}

    AP -- Yes --> AQ[Increase device count]

    AP -- No --> AR{Family code is DS2413}

    AR -- Yes --> AS[Store DS2413 ROM]
    AS --> AT[Set DS2413 found flag]
    AT --> AN

    AR -- No --> AN

    AQ --> AN

    AN -- No --> AU{Device count greater than zero or DS2413 found}

    AU -- Yes --> AV[Break search loop]
    AU -- No --> AK

    AV --> AK

    AK --> AL
    AL --> AF

    AH -- Yes --> AI2[Print DS2413 ROM]
    AH -- No --> AJ2[Continue]

    AI2 --> AJ2

    AJ2 --> AK2[Store LoRa RSSI]
    AK2 --> AL2[Store cycle start time]
    AL2 --> AM2[Set initialization flag]
    AM2 --> AN2([End])
